{"scope":"rt-ada99f2ff5","css":".rt-ada99f2ff5 p.MsoNormal, .rt-ada99f2ff5 li.MsoNormal, .rt-ada99f2ff5 div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;}\n.rt-ada99f2ff5 h1 {margin:0cm; text-align:center; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:16.0pt; font-family:\"Courier New\"; text-decoration:underline;}\n.rt-ada99f2ff5 p.MsoBodyText, .rt-ada99f2ff5 li.MsoBodyText, .rt-ada99f2ff5 div.MsoBodyText {margin:0cm; font-size:11.0pt; font-family:\"Courier New\";}\n.rt-ada99f2ff5 p.MsoNoSpacing, .rt-ada99f2ff5 li.MsoNoSpacing, .rt-ada99f2ff5 div.MsoNoSpacing {margin:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;}\n.rt-ada99f2ff5 div.WordSection1 {}","html":"<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251657216;left:-52px;\r\ntop:18px;width:994px;height:20px'><img width=795 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlh4gMCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAADiAwIAgAAAAAAAAAJGBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsChwaiUYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9ytNwEoAAA7\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT OF\r\nRADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>U.S.G\r\nREPORT OF KUB &amp; PROSTATE<\/span><\/h1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>RIGHT\r\nKIDNEY<\/span><\/u><\/b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\r\n<b>:<\/b> <\/span><\/u><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoBodyText><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right\r\nkidney is normal in shape, size and location. Cortical echotexture is normal\r\nwith preserved cortico medullary echo differentiation.No calculus \/ cyst \/\r\nsolid mass \/ hydronephrosis is noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right\r\nKidney measures : 0.00 x 0.00 cm(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>LEFT\r\nKIDNEY<\/span><\/u><\/b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\r\n<b>:<\/b> <\/span><\/u><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left\r\nkidney is normal in shape, size and location.Cortical echotexture is normal\r\nwith preserved cortico medullary echo differentiation.No calculus \/ cyst \/\r\nsolid mass \/ hydronephrosis is noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left\r\nKidney measures : 0.00 x 0.00 cm(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>KIDNEYS\r\n<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:<\/span><\/u><\/b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/u><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Both\r\nkidneys are normal in shape, size and location.Cortical echotexture is normal\r\nwith preserved cortico medullary echo differentiation. No calculus \/cyst \/\r\nsolid mass \/ hydronephrosis is noted. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right\r\nKidney Measure\u00a0\u00a0 : 0.00 x 0.00 cm.(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left\u00a0\r\nKidney Measure\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 : 0.00 x 0.00 cm.(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>URETERS<\/span><\/u><\/b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <b>:<\/b> <\/span><\/u><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Both\r\nureters are not dilated hence not visualised.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>URINARY\r\nBLADDER<\/span><\/u><\/b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\r\n<b>:<\/b> <\/span><\/u><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>It\r\nis optimally distended. Wall is normal in thickness.No focal lesions are\r\ndetected.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>PROSTATE\r\n: <\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Prostate\r\nis normal in size, shape. Parenchymal echotexture is heterogeneous.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Capsular\r\noutline is intact.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Prostate\r\nmeasures : 0.00 x 0.00 x 0.00 cm.(approx) and volume : 00 cc.(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>POST\r\nVOID <\/span><\/u><\/b><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:<\/span><\/u><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The\r\npost void residual volume of urine is insignificant and measures :\u00a0\u00a0 ml\r\n(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>UTERUS\r\n: <\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Uterus\r\nis normal in shape, size and position. Endometrial echo is normal in thickness.\r\nMyometrial echopattern is normal.Cervix and vagina appear normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Uterus\r\nmeasures : 00 x 00 x 00 cm(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>OVARIES\r\n: <\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Both\r\nthe ovaries are bulky in size with increased stromal thickness and echo seen.\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Multiple\r\nanechoic cystic area scattered in bilateral ovaries &gt; 7 in number in <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>each\r\n&lt;1 cm. in diameter. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Both\r\novaries are normal in shape, size and echotexture. No obvious mass lesion seen.\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right\r\nOvary measures\u00a0 : 00 x 00 cm.(approx) and <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left\u00a0\u00a0\r\nOvary measures\u00a0 : 00 x 00 cm(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>POUCH\r\nOF DOUGLAS : <\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No\r\nobvious collection \/ SOL seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ILIAC\r\nFOSSA SCAN<\/span><\/u><\/b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\r\n<b>:<\/b><\/span><\/u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Both\r\niliac fossae appear normal.No obvious collection \/ SOL seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Both\r\npsoas muscles are normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>IMPRESSION<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/u><\/b><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>NORMAL STUDY.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Suggested\r\n:-<\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\r\nOther relevant investigation, follow up &amp; clinical correlation.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n